**WHAT YOU ARE ACTUALLY BUILDING**

One local system with two modes:

Mode 1: Warmup System - emails talking to each other naturally to build domain reputation.

Mode 2: Campaign System - real cold emails to real leads with sequence automation and HubSpot integration.

---

**TECH STACK**

Runtime: Bun
Framework: Hono
Database: SQLite via bun:sqlite
Email Sending: Nodemailer
IMAP Reply Checking: imapflow
Scheduling: Bun.cron
HubSpot Integration: HubSpot API free tier
UI: Simple HTML + vanilla JS served by Hono

