**COMPLETE FEATURE LIST**

---

**Module 1: Warmup System**

- Upload ChatGPT generated JSON conversation files
- System reads JSON and schedules each email at specified random times
- Emails send automatically throughout the day
- Auto reply logic between warmup Gmail accounts
- Warmup log tracking every email sent and received
- Daily warmup volume control per account
- Warmup status dashboard showing health per account

---

**Module 2: Account Management**

- Add and manage sending accounts (Google Workspace)
- Add and manage warmup pool accounts (Gmail)
- Track emails sent today per account
- Track daily limits per account
- Account health status: warming, ready, paused, flagged

---

**Module 3: Lead Management**

- Import leads via CSV from Apollo export
- Store first name, last name, email, company, website, personalized line
- Filter leads by status: active, replied, bounced, finished, unsubscribed
- Manual lead editing
- Duplicate detection on import

---

**Module 4: Campaign Management**

- Create campaigns with name and settings
- Assign leads to a campaign
- Set daily sending limit per campaign
- Set sending schedule: days and hours
- Set sending account per campaign
- Pause and resume campaigns
- Campaign status: draft, active, paused, completed

---

**Module 5: Sequence Builder**

- Create multi step email sequences per campaign
- Step 1: initial email, day 0
- Step 2: follow up, configurable delay in days
- Step 3: final follow up, configurable delay in days
- Subject line and body per step
- Variable support in body: first name, company, personalized line
- Preview email before launching

---

**Module 6: Email Sender**

- Sends emails on schedule automatically
- Random delay between emails: 60 to 180 seconds to look human
- Respects daily limits per account
- Only sends Monday to Friday within configured hours
- Marks lead as finished when all steps complete
- Logs every sent email with timestamp

---

**Module 7: Reply Detection**

- Checks IMAP inbox every 2 hours automatically
- Detects replies from leads
- Stops sequence automatically when reply detected
- Updates lead status to replied
- Logs reply with timestamp
- Triggers HubSpot contact creation automatically

---

**Module 8: HubSpot Integration**

- When reply detected, automatically creates contact in HubSpot
- Pushes contact to pipeline at New Reply stage
- Sends lead name, email, company, and reply snippet to HubSpot
- Uses HubSpot free API, no paid plan needed
- Sohrab only sees HubSpot, never touches your system

---

**Module 9: Dashboard and Analytics**

- Warmup status per account
- Emails sent today vs daily limit
- Campaign performance: sent, opened, replied, bounced
- Reply rate and positive reply rate
- Active leads count
- Recent activity log

